#: ../../getting_started/installation/distributed/overview.rst:4
msgid "HA Installation Overview"
msgstr "HA Installation Overview"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/distributed/overview.rst:6
msgid ""
"|morpheus| provides a wide array of options when it comes to deployment "
"architectures. It can start as a simple one machine instance where all "
"services run on the same machine, or it can be split off into individual "
"services per machine and configured in a high availability (HA) "
"configuration, either in the same region or cross-region. Naturally, high"
" availability can grow more complicated, depending on the configuration "
"you want to do and this article will cover the basic concepts of the "
"|morpheus| HA architecture that can be used in a wide array of "
"configurations."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| provides una amplia variedad de options when it comes to "
"deployment architectures. It can start as a simple one machine instance "
"where todos los servicios run on the mismo machine, o it puede ser split "
"off en individual services per machine y configurado in a high "
"availability (HA) configuration, ya sea in the mismo region o cross-"
"region. Naturally, high availability can grow more complicated, "
"dependiendo de la configuración you want to do y this article will cover "
"the basic concepts of the |morpheus| HA architecture that puede usarse in"
" una amplia variedad de configurations."

#: ../../getting_started/installation/distributed/overview.rst:8
msgid ""
"There are four primary tiers of services represented within the "
"|morpheus| appliance. They are the Application Tier, Transactional "
"Database Tier, Non-Transactional Database Tier, and Messaging Tier. Each "
"of these tiers have their own recommendations for High availability "
"deployments."
msgstr ""
"There are four primary tiers of services represented dentro de the "
"|morpheus| appliance. They are the Application Tier, Transactional "
"Database Tier, Non-Transactional Database Tier, y Messaging Tier. Each de"
" lase tiers have their own recommendations for High availability "
"deployments."

#: ../../getting_started/installation/distributed/overview.rst:10
msgid "Important"
msgstr ""

